# WRSRE agent entry point (legacy Cline rules)

Read `AGENTS.md`, `INSTRUCTIONS.md` and the relevant parts of
`KILO_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md` before acting. Those files are the maintained source of
project, safety, native-evidence and coordination rules; this file intentionally
does not duplicate them. Respect higher-priority session instructions and the
user's task scope.

Check the actual working directory, branch, host, shell and tool availability.
Historical Windows paths, installed software and Ghidra access are not promises
about the current environment. Keep existing changes and serialize access to
each Ghidra project. Verify consequential findings against accessible raw
artifacts; if a cited artifact is missing, report that rather than guessing or
restarting work unnecessarily. Do not make runtime changes or implement hooks
without the authorization required by the task.
